{"title":"Easter Eggs","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Easter_Eggs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Easter Eggs</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Known_Easter_Eggs_on_the_AoPS_website\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Easter Eggs on the AoPS website</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Jeremy_Hates_Somebody\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Jeremy Hates Somebody</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Steps_to_Reproduce\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps to Reproduce</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#MANGLED_SQUARE_ROOTS\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">MANGLED SQUARE ROOTS</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Steps_to_Reproduce_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps to Reproduce</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#BTS_April_Fools\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">BTS April Fools</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Color_Changing_April_Fools\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Color Changing April Fools</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#PickleRick\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">PickleRick</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Steps_to_Reproduce_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps to Reproduce</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#42\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">42</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Steps_to_Reproduce_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps to Reproduce</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Complex_Tomfoolery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Complex Tomfoolery</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Steps_to_Reproduce_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.7.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps to Reproduce</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Foo\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Foo</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#Steps_to_Reproduce_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.8.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps to Reproduce</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#Old_AoPS\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Old AoPS</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Easter_Eggs\">Easter Eggs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Easter_Eggs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Easter Eggs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><b>Easter Eggs</b> are hidden features of movies, websites, TV shows, video games, or other media. The first Easter Egg to ever be made was in 1980, in the Atari 2600 game <i>Adventure</i>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Easter_Eggs_on_the_AoPS_website\">Known Easter Eggs on the AoPS website</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Easter_Eggs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Known Easter Eggs on the AoPS website\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Jeremy_Hates_Somebody\">Jeremy Hates Somebody</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Easter_Eggs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Jeremy Hates Somebody\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>When you go to a class and click on “Report Error”, you can find “jeremy-he-hate-me” when Inspecting the page.  Discovered by <b>Lionking212</b>.\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps_to_Reproduce\">Steps to Reproduce</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Easter_Eggs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Steps to Reproduce\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ol><li>Go to a class page</li>\n<li>Click on \"Report Error\" on the homework tab</li>\n<li>Inspect Element (Or F12)</li>\n<li>Search for \"jeremy\"</li></ol>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"MANGLED_SQUARE_ROOTS\">MANGLED SQUARE ROOTS</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Easter_Eggs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: MANGLED SQUARE ROOTS\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>When you go to a homework problem, if you type sqrta+sqrtb the result shows as \\sqrta+THISISAMANGLEDSQUAREROOTb. If you type THISISAMANGLEDSQUAREROOTa the result is \\sqrta. Discovered by <b>wamofan</b>.\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps_to_Reproduce_2\">Steps to Reproduce</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Easter_Eggs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Steps to Reproduce\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ol><li>Go to Alcumus</li>\n<li>Click \"Play\"</li>\n<li>Type \"sqrta+sqrtb\" into the answer box</li>\n<li>Type \"THISISAMANGLEDSQUAREROOTa\"</li></ol>\n<p>Note: this also works with the input \"sqrta+sqrtc\". Or \"sqrta+sqrtgmaas\" for that matter.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"BTS_April_Fools\">BTS April Fools</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Easter_Eggs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: BTS April Fools\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>On April Fools day 2022, in every class’s homepage there was a link saying “Extra Credit Opportunity!”. If you click that, you get a page with a BTS choreography video. \n</p><p>Unable to be reproduced.\nEDIT: This can only be reproduced on april fools.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Color_Changing_April_Fools\">Color Changing April Fools</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Easter_Eggs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Color Changing April Fools\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>On April Fools day 2024, clicking the \"Extra Credit Opportunity!\" link in each class's homepage made the colors on the page change. On April 1 2025, this same easter egg worked.\n</p><p>This can also only be reproduced on April Fools.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"PickleRick\">PickleRick</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Easter_Eggs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: PickleRick\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>When you click inspect on any AoPS page, and go to sources and go to raven.min.js, it shows {return newRequest(\"pickleRick\". You will have to scroll to the left a lot, so if you just do cmd+f or ctrl+f and search pickleRick, you will see it.  Discovered by llr.\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps_to_Reproduce_3\">Steps to Reproduce</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Easter_Eggs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Steps to Reproduce\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ol><li>Go to any AoPS page</li>\n<li>Inspect</li>\n<li>Go to raven.min.js on the Sources tab</li>\n<li>Search for \"pickleRick\"</li></ol>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"42\">42</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Easter_Eggs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: 42\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>If you go to <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/category-admin/88\">https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/category-admin/88</a>, or the info of the AoPS Blogroll, you see a message saying 42, or life the universe and everything. Discovered by Andrew2019.\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps_to_Reproduce_4\">Steps to Reproduce</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Easter_Eggs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Steps to Reproduce\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ol><li>Go to the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//artofproblemsolving.com/community/category-admin/88\">AoPS Blogroll</a></li>\n<li>Click the info button</li>\n<li>Wait for the 42 message to show.</li></ol>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Complex_Tomfoolery\">Complex Tomfoolery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Easter_Eggs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: Complex Tomfoolery\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>In Introduction to Algebra A, for week 15, the homework problems are numbered 1+i, 2+i, 3+i… instead of 1, 2, 3…\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps_to_Reproduce_5\">Steps to Reproduce</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Easter_Eggs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14\" title=\"Edit section: Steps to Reproduce\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ol><li>Go to the <b>Introduction to Algebra A</b> class if you are enrolled</li>\n<li>Click on the Homework tab</li>\n<li>Click on \"Week 15\"</li></ol>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Foo\">Foo</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Easter_Eggs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=15\" title=\"Edit section: Foo\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><tt>[tip = spam]foo[/tip]</tt> displays \"<tt>foo</tt>\" when you hover over the tip. This is a bug where the HTML generated by the tip command in the AoPS community gets escaped. <i>Tips just show as plaintext in classroom.</i> \n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps_to_Reproduce_6\">Steps to Reproduce</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Easter_Eggs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=16\" title=\"Edit section: Steps to Reproduce\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ol><li>Make a new post in a forum or your blog</li>\n<li>Insert <tt>[tip = spam]foo[/tip]</tt> as well as some other text (the minimum is 8 characters)</li>\n<li>Click on Preview or Submit</li>\n<li>Hover over the tip</li></ol>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Old_AoPS\">Old AoPS</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Easter_Eggs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=17\" title=\"Edit section: Old AoPS\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/nostalgia\">https://artofproblemsolving.com/nostalgia</a> shows how AoPS used to look in 2003.\n</p><p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Easter_Eggs&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017154455\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.020 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 61/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 297/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.297      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.297      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:22700:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017154455 and revision id 263012. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}